  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/c0d62b766ce89319772285e738dcf4a59b40b2d9_0.webp\" alt=\"Amped Up Logo W/ Fasttrack\"> Evo: Amped Up 是 KonaDolomite 所開發的模組「Alien Evolution」的擴展，新增了更多外星人變身形態。</p><h1>加入 Discord 搶先看預告！</h1><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/J5x9kCAzYf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EAU Discord</a></p><h1>特色功能</h1><h2>Fasttrack - 在 Citrakayah 神廟中找到毛球後獲得。</h2><h3>運動模式關閉</h3><ul>\n<li>啟用運動模式</li>\n<li>上勾拳</li>\n<li>[蹲下]：飛踢</li>\n<li>無形穿透</li>\n<li>地面重擊</li>\n<li>右鍵點擊：斬擊</li>\n</ul><h3>運動模式開啟</h3><ul>\n<li>關閉運動模式</li>\n<li>衝刺攻擊</li>\n<li>(蹲下)：滑行踢擊</li>\n<li>殘影打擊</li>\n<li>跳躍</li>\n<li>(跳躍後)：旋風重擊</li>\n<li>(蹲下)：加速衝刺</li>\n</ul><h3>被動技能</h3><ul>\n<li>膽小貓咪</li>\n<li>身體衝撞</li>\n</ul><h1>依賴模組</h1><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthreetag-palladium\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Palladium</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fgeckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fkubejs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kubejs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252farchitectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252falienevo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alien Evolution</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpehkui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pehkui</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frhino\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rhino</a></li>\n</ul><h3>特別感謝：</h3><ul>\n<li>Awildcanofbeans</li>\n<li>Pakios</li>\n<li>Staxbyte</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@TimmyRock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Timmyrock</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fguns.lol%252fhibiquill\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quill</a></li>\n<li>Babish</li>\n</ul>",
